DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The rrddaacc driver attaches to Engenio/LSI RDAC SCSI logical units.  Each
     path to an active service processor attached to by rrddaacc is presented to
     mpath(4) which uses it as a backend to the logical unit attached to its
     own scsibus(4).

